  "description": "Yong-Hee, whose only dream was to live happily with the grandmother who raised her, suddenly found a scumbag calling her \"Dragon Head\" with the words, \"Dragon~! Head ! Aren't you coming over quickly ?!\" Chan-Young, who is pretty on the outside but hateful the moment he opens his mouth, uses his innate scumbag nature to turn Yong-Hee's life upside down. \"You've really messed with me.\" Yong-Hee, who was helplessly wavering, was unaware that she was about to leave, turning her back on the fresh scent of roses.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=10758024), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11227036) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850885), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14178960)",
